## Why This Is Asked
This tests building secure, observable SAP on AWS with automated incident response across accounts.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-account data collection and IAM trust
- Kinesis Firehose + S3/Redshift storage
- Anomaly detection with SageMaker or Glue
- Event-driven remediation via Lambda + EventBridge
- Auditing and immutable logs

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal CDK-like snippet for a cross-account data sink
import * as iam from 'aws-cdk-lib/aws-iam';
import * as kinesis from 'aws-cdk-lib/aws-kinesis';
import * as cdk from 'aws-cdk-lib';
class SapObservabilityStack extends cdk.Stack {
  constructor(scope, id, props) {
    super(scope, id, props);
    const stream = new kinesis.Stream(this, 'SapAccessStream', { shardCount: 1 });
    stream.grantPutRecords(new iam.AccountRootPrincipal());
  }
}
```

